# Route: guide 1 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 1 to 12, 55
# quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dun Morogh): Coldridge Pass -> Coldridge Valley -> The Grizzled Den ->
# Ironforge -> Coldridge Valley -> The Grizzled Den -> Shimmer Ridge -> The
# Grizzled Den -> Ironforge -> Shimmer Ridge -> Ironforge -> The Grizzled Den
# -> Misty Pine Refuge -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Protecting the Herd (314; Vagash
# 11).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 95217 The
# Quarry's Smith; 96031 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 96044 Camping 101:
# Blacksmithing; 96046 Camping 101: Mining; 96047 Camping 101: First Aid;
# 96050 Camping 101: Fishing; 96055 Camping 101: Herbalism; 96056 Camping 101:
# Skinning; 96057 Camping 101: Tailoring; 96058 Camping 101: Engineering.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): A Fine Mess (2904), The Sparklematic 5200! (2951), The
# Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), The Only Cure is More Green Glow
# (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393), Old
# Ironforge Incursion (96393).

